    "body": "## Summary\n- resolve an active leaf service category by slug in the reviews/trust smoke\n- create the smoke-test job with the now-required `categoryId`\n- trigger the reviews/trust workflow when its workflow definition itself changes in a PR\n\n## Why\n`master` is currently green in the main CI but `Reviews trust smoke` fails while creating its fixture job because job creation now requires a selectable leaf category. This keeps the smoke aligned with the production job contract instead of weakening category validation.\n\n## Validation\nGitHub Actions should run the updated Reviews trust smoke plus repository CI on this PR. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
